        "commentDate": "2022-06-21T05:57:37.7299727",
        "htmlComment": "<p>Gholb گردد کارها نه Gholb ) !!!! Ghalb یعنی : فریب حیله !!!&nbsp;</p>",
        "publishStatus": "",
        "inReplyToId": null,
        "userId": "3a4039f1-9b57-448a-6ab1-08da5322af91",
        "replies": [
          {
